// Repo-root manifest, read by `nextflow pull` / `nextflow run <repo>`.
//
// The pipelines in this repo live in subdirectories (currently data-io/), and
// each carries its own full nextflow.config. Nextflow loads that one at run
// time, because -main-script sets projectDir to the subdirectory.
//
// This file exists for one thing Nextflow needs BEFORE that: when it clones the
// repo it reads only the root manifest, so `recurseSubmodules` has to be here
// or the nf-mod-* submodules are never fetched and every include fails with a
// missing modules/... path.
//
// Deliberately no `mainScript`: that would claim the repo root for one
// subproject. Pick the pipeline per run instead:
//
//   nextflow run EIT-GBI/bioinf-tests -latest -main-script data-io/main.nf -entry verify
manifest {
    recurseSubmodules = true
}
